itle</strong> (<em>str</em>) \u2013 What needs doing.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>completed</strong> (<em>bool</em>) \u2013 Whether the todo is done.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>created_at</strong> (<em>datetime</em>) \u2013 When the todo was created (UTC).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>extra</strong> (<em>dict</em><em>[</em><em>str</em><em>, </em><em>Any</em><em>]</em>) \u2013 Any fields the server returned that this SDK version doesn\u2019t know yet.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.models.Todo.id\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">id</span></span><span class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.models.Todo.id\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.models.Todo.title\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">title</span></span><span class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.models.Todo.title\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.models.Todo.completed\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">completed</span></span><span class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.models.Todo.completed\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.models.Todo.created_at\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">created_at</span></